{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、雲の流れがすごく早かったなぁ。(o^^o)ほくほく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつもより低かったです ○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手が届きそうでした  (*^_^*) ***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに近いのに...、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際は、ものすごく遠いんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議だなぁ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人もおんなじだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近く見えてたのに実は遠かったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に、距離は遠くても心は繋がってたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前に見えていたことが\n実は、すごく 儚かったり、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際、見えていたものと違うことばかり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この世界は不思議なことばっかりです！(`_´)げふっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからね、 目に見えるものが\n全部すべて正しいとは、\n限らないんだよね。(´･_･` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目に見えることがすべてじゃない...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えないもののほうが、\n実は、ずっと大切なのかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか深いことを言っていたような\n気がするけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、駅ですれ違った少年が友達にむかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい世界でコンティニューしようぜっ！ｄ(^_−)-☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、言っていたので\n全部吹っ飛んでゆきました。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだそれーーーーっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっとビーーーーーーム！☆☆ でゅくしっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っっ ｄ(^_−)-☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぼすっぴんごめんなさいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、どおして私、メンバーとの写真を\nあまり載せていないかというと、\n気が弱くて一緒に撮ろうって中々\n言えないからですσ(^_^;)えへ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、メンバーの写真だったら\n携帯のフォルダにたーっくさん入っています＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このようにっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのこと写真に撮るのは好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのこと、大好きっ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目に見えないから伝わってるか心配だけど、\nいつも読んでくれて有難うございます(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい世界でコンティニューしようぜっ！ｄ(^_−)-☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/8568578/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"imag